<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Account Verification</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/confirmation.css">
</head>

<body>

<div class="top-bar"></div>

<div class="verification-card">

    <div class="logo">
        <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Company Logo">
    </div>

    <h1>Account Verification</h1>

    <p class="greeting">Dear Customer,</p>

    <p>
        Please ensure your safety. It appears that some information associated with your account is missing or incorrect. Kindly wait a moment while one of our representatives reviews your account and provides you with the correct information. Once this is resolved, you'll be able to continue enjoying the full benefits of your account.
        
    </p>

    <div class="status">
        <div class="spinner"></div>

        <div>
            <strong>Status</strong><br>
            Verification in Progress...
        </div>
    </div>



</div>

<footer>
    © 2026 Wells Fargo<br>
    Please do not reply to this automated message.
</footer>

</body>
</html>